#question(title: [A simple BCT application])[
  #set text(size: 13pt)

  We want to determine whether
  $display(integral_1^oo 1/(x + e^x) thick d x)$
   \
  is convergent or divergent.

  We can try at least two comparisons:

  + Compare $display(1/x)$ and
    $display(1/(x + e^x))$.
  + Compare $display(1/(e^x))$ and
    $display(1/(x + e^x))$.

  Try both. What can you conclude from each
  one of them?
]
